## Service Ownership

notificationTemplates.js

Responsibilities:

* Notification titles
* Notification messages
* Categories
* Priorities

No database access.

No business logic.

---

notificationFactory.js

Responsibilities:

* Create notification objects
* Apply defaults
* Validate inputs

No persistence.

---

notificationRepository.js

Responsibilities:

* Storage abstraction
* Adapter management

No business logic.

No UI logic.

Default adapter:

Not Configured

Future adapters:

* Supabase
* REST API
* PostgreSQL

---

notificationService.js

Responsibilities:

* Dispatch notifications
* Get notifications
* Mark read
* Mark all read
* Get unread count

This is the ONLY approved public entry point.

External modules must never call:

* notificationFactory.js
* notificationRepository.js

directly.

